    "1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:242eb0dda5582bd3f37fa26ab1791189097ef596c052e60be72639d3534b8c00",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_4:1_5_002_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "さーてと、仕事の準備しよっと。\n今日も完璧にこなしてくるからね！",
        "text": "好～啦，准备去工作喽。\n今天也会完美完成回来的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:69e5adb5c468581c3ccfdfc7a9aca589b165097778533946b11866cce0916750",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_4:1_5_002_00_4:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:264c6766d3fddade64bc21308186182bf7d4bc12095db421b869e7dbcad0cb89",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_5:1_5_003_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "トレーニングをしてきていいですか？\n常に最高の体に仕上げておきたいので。",
        "text": "我可以去做下锻炼吗？\n因为我想始终把身体保持在最佳状态。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:28c7ecc09d2785c81ddb9090a0852a08c1e43e653cd0af029f159ad88039028f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_5:1_5_003_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:00eb140815e3ff209651e369a85ee490c9be74f25c6662b16ace4f6286868406",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_1:1_5_006_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "本番前にもう一度、台本を確認したいんですけど\n付き合ってもらえますか？",
        "text": "开演前我还想再确认一遍台词本，\n能陪我一下吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d0a401fb94f48f9fd59f813218980bb0bd088bebffc019c8689eda3e05484e1a",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_1:1_5_006_00_1:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:3aa2e5393f66c983924c2a0ab146bef39d2ef9b3d7f208a8147473a7348b9e4e",
      "title": 201,
      "opening": {
        "source": "翼さん、今度のお仕事の資料が届きましたので\nお渡ししますね。",
        "text": "翼先生，下次工作的资料送到了，\n这就交给您。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9e17fe7c45d61501e0a50a4faa01dcc3a900e2a3fcc15d6ad82bff291d1b9a19",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_04:1_5_006_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_007kei_1_5_007_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:3782038e4fb3487ee3d3cc85a9d41a9d68f2b1243497928281b03491b434f23b",
      "title": 202,
      "opening": {
        "source": "トレーニング、って話だったけれど、\n外でするのかい？",
        "text": "虽说说是要锻炼，\n但要在室外做吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:064f40a5099f52deda7c6c83cf63a220ec1478b52538952588409ab163a71207",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_007kei_1_5_007_01:1_5_007_01:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:9427c84ef14cb8f576d41ffef941a7003634d9c6bf6e6b338d0c75f0c76d68ff",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_5:1_5_008_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "貴殿がわたしに任せてくれた仕事だ、\nしっかりこなしてこよう。",
        "text": "既然是阁下托付给我的工作，\n我自当全力完成。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d87060374145ce44f7058ca523c7efc38f2bed62be9f96af94cdfa2aee1604e4",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_5:1_5_008_00_5:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:5877050617069a6509622943b572a826a1161112af218b068f23c5954dd03a29",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_5:1_5_011_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "現場によって雰囲気ががらりと変わるよね。\n次はどんな現場になるか、楽しみだよ。",
        "text": "根据现场不同气氛也会大变样呢。\n很期待下次会是怎样的现场哦。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:863d536ffcc3688cf3cbdc95c8d7bd26a29d52dad6f018b0355ad5f2bcec0aa5",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_5:1_5_011_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:9377730b1e80b5fc030cd1e5549e010583393c138479f079b72d06f5e347cc02",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_8:1_5_012_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "アイドルってすっげー楽しい！\nオレ、もっと頑張るよ！",
        "text": "当偶像真的超级开心！\n我会更加加油的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:a931da49fbf3a4e6d43e88c817ff1f40156a406ff0b28b6d1f6d5281e7aa55b6",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_8:1_5_012_00_8:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:bff1a1dbc4e62df25690bdf51537856cad58a404a286c6849caf3c5166ee0b58",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_4:1_5_013_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お客さんの声、すごいね……。\nへへ、絶対いいステージにしてみせるよ！",
        "text": "观众们的欢呼声，真厉害啊……\n嘿嘿，我绝对会呈现出一场精彩的舞台给大家看的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ad811f8c36d7119022fe9457f034b64b78409a98b63805f76e1495f7522c9cfe",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_4:1_5_013_00_4:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:e2270f781c87e476be86e27b096eb66a4364635c390adb97724df0a91368d27e",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_2:1_5_014_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "昨日は信玄の家で夕飯食って、龍とキメポーズの\n練習をしたんだ。その成果、これから見せてやるよ。",
        "text": "昨天在信玄家吃了晚饭，还和龙一起练习了\n定格动作。接下来就给你看看练习的成果吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:668ff7d89b559bfc06fc35ee17f77a750608051e476d080194695afa1dea51fe",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_2:1_5_014_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:cfcc4020fda912a48e3db4bc11d5f9e991a01e7c2b1604f0655c26237f7489a1",
      "title": 232,
      "opening": {
        "source": "もうすぐ本番ですね。\n緊張しているようですが……大丈夫ですか？",
        "text": "马上就要正式开始了呢。\n看起来您好像有点紧张……没问题吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4107d77e8fa658f4f8654a305f1637804ccf99fb439b2d70ef80fcce40a4123e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_03:1_5_014_03:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:57a6ff78defd126cbf716b7a2bf10683ccd47e4d508270624ad5ed0fcd778a8f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_1:1_5_015_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "本番でミスらないように入念に靴紐を結んで……。\nこれでよし……って、早速紐が切れてるんだけど！？",
        "text": "为了在正式上场时不失误，仔细地系好鞋带……\n这样就行了……等等，鞋带马上就断掉了哎！？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d77307cd90123717b385fef5b69b55c105aafba05e01608fb79f755938bb7178",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_1:1_5_015_00_1:cmd-000022:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:6d0ad39c43a0bcee5184cf735585c9061a926db98754725ba0fc4b5e296775da",
      "title": 237,
      "opening": {
        "source": "龍さん、お疲れ様です。\nCM撮影の方は順調ですか？",
        "text": "龙先生，辛苦了。\n广告拍摄还顺利吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c5a9b86aac28c87e7e64af919f5185f75211696faf342cb3e84f18626e542cd1",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_04:1_5_015_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:0c1eee84a778d175f68ffc7b218c7fa07524e9cd7448279234e77f85d3afa081",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_4:1_5_016_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れ様、プロデューサーさん。\n次の任務に向かうとしようか！",
        "text": "辛苦了，制作人。\n让我们前往下一项任务吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:6d40688b0f854d920378b14601260e57740f354a89f6cbb7b2928cd2ed2a5b9f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_4:1_5_016_00_4:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:b418efb42bc818bdbc7a433191c378467d88fdcffa1525d22487de27976ef1a6",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_7:1_5_017_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "体を動かすと頭がすっきりするでにゃんす。\nこのあとは事務所に戻って台本を読むでにゃんすよ。",
        "text": "活动完身体头脑就清醒了喵。\n待会儿回事务所去看台词本喵。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f13eb471a3e8bd17a58e428ceb3cb25cfd02c0fb9681bccb6630d9a111a5aafd",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_7:1_5_017_00_7:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:b2a95d73fc2eb37a74290d358d5c21600a9629c52a46310a1a76dc822c40bb93",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_1:1_5_018_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "あら、気づいた？　今日の仕事のために\nいつも以上にお肌のお手入れをしてきたのさ。",
        "text": "哎呀，你发现啦？为了今天的工作，\n我可是比平时更用心地保养了肌肤呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2e72f7951f1d2d6a353b0047e1e26b0c5a29d55f879a621c348f9ee2c5c450d5",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_1:1_5_018_00_1:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_018shm_1_5_018_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:1364d0ec6e8894be4902e06a95381358d6aec7aacabce765d17ed04e2114683d",
      "title": 249,
      "opening": {
        "source": "いい画が撮れたって監督が喜んでいたけど。\n急に天候が崩れるなんて思ってもみなかったわ。",
        "text": "导演高兴地夸奖拍到了好镜头呢。\n不过完全没想到天气会突然变差啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:90aabffa9ae0f5c1e69addad00ca8618781bb2571d571ee69ac12da741a6fb0a",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_04:1_5_018_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:29b3ecc01b1b3554ed984ccedc2d824987892d5cf0504fd45035ae6d4a59914a",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_7:1_5_020_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "シキってホントに歌が上手いよな。\nよし、コツを聞いてこよう！",
        "text": "四季唱歌真的好厉害啊。\n好，去问问他有什么诀窍吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c20fc4f83a3e9ed8027529775cfeaa06e1dc3c5582346d55be3b11891465fb48",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_7:1_5_020_00_7:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:93a4fb862f25052bc5c82202e51b53254ab9cfe07283b70985f3e8d1cd5e6fb3",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_2:1_5_022_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "……ジュン、かっこいい……え？\n俺もかっこいい……？　えっと……ありがとう……。",
        "text": "……旬，好帅气……诶？\n我也很帅气……？那个……谢谢……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:fc8ac6fb8cd161416f9d9724277eef25a6bdc3b876c6b3c0f48fbe8c816e8c7d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_2:1_5_022_00_2:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_022nat_1_5_022_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:91621caced5891b08901b87a10a171ea3aa710a3859a7516bcffa84cd3a8606a",
      "title": 264,
      "opening": {
        "source": "夏来さんに、ファッションコーディネートアプリの\nCMオファーが来ました！",
        "text": "夏来先生，收到了穿搭搭配应用的\n广告邀约！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9a4446330b1f5326dd6c4014c657c9f7f4b61f48976bf6f5ed3160e976e992cb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_03:1_5_022_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:776115924fbca2beb7d92f396234e0a659cba91c67f2e80f5f3e50ee583057c9",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_8:1_5_023_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "疲れた時は、やっぱドーナツだよな！\n●●●●プロデューサーも食うか？",
        "text": "累了的时候，果然还是得吃甜甜圈啊！\n●●●●プロデューサー也要吃吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2c89a1e642147f7051821fc9d67505c41c435fb651d2af397bfe822f354b0eb3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_8:1_5_023_00_8:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:51793ff8aa49e4755a7b7eed475114c560acced988cb0aed74bd72790e99fca3",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_5:1_5_024_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーちゃん。\nオレ、もっと歌いたいっす！",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n我还想唱更多歌！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8d66e5dabff981751208027dbaedbd4122b5fffb3b54c540da8e01d78091fb99",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_5:1_5_024_00_5:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:14041ce5b0a816d45926975415edba9831d3e5f5588f8e411818a9d82415ca61",
      "title": 279,
      "opening": {
        "source": "げ、玄武さん……。\nよかったら、この本を……わわっ！？",
        "text": "玄、玄武先生……\n方便的话，这几本书……哇哇！？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c7818a9cba04b2527a953560d21e50f96bf586dd17c0fec39d63f86943932677",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_02:1_5_026_02:cmd-000013:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:926efc936d4a5373353b9ff0e5a78d469142a698cf50946387bedbdb28ec0b76",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_8:1_5_027_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ああ、準備ならバッチリさ。\nそれでは行ってくるよ、プロデューサーさん。",
        "text": "嗯，准备工作万无一失。\n那么我出发了，制作人。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ee0bcca62f8d27e9ffe1f50bc544def9013eb3595614c6010081cb6025ab763f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_8:1_5_027_00_8:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:9071b67aad8d9c7137c82632b02d5c82f6d75fcf8f60573f2aa8889855359395",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_8:1_5_028_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れさまです。プロデューサーさんから見て、\n今日の仕事はいかがでしたか？",
        "text": "辛苦了。在制作人看来，\n今天的工作表现如何？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b3d2158807ec211137339fcb41b834b7f25d419cfc83c02a6db3576a351740bf",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_8:1_5_028_00_8:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_030mak_1_5_030_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:6391b06912d28c8522ca9689f7352618ca8bad490c8e92c83dad86e07691ec4b",
      "title": 294,
      "opening": {
        "source": "リハーサルお疲れさまでした！\n●●●●プロデューサーさんから見て、どうでした？",
        "text": "彩排辛苦了！\n在●●●●プロデューサー看来，感觉怎么样？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ceddaaaecb90788477d69d2d7674dfe55c29a970f401a1b9801bdca8722d3e57",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_030mak_1_5_030_01:1_5_030_01:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:3ed243abfcd346eb018d59a6beeb0bea7a5d56e6aa65d15b15fefce9bdac87b7",
      "title": 298,
      "opening": {
        "source": "ねえねえ、●●●●プロデューサー！\n本番まだかな？　パピパピワクワク♪",
        "text": "呐呐，●●●●プロデューサー！\n还没到正式开拍吗？Papi Papi兴奋期待♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c28df2147930f75b2fc3040a18f766818c0c1229ceec276fda37fb2688e8c51f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_01:1_5_031_01:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:73ca7811d150b892ef8de773602a0ac78e45f57097596df2202397a0d4272eb2",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_5:1_5_032_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "トレーナーさんに褒められました！\nえへへ……♪",
        "text": "被教练夸奖了！\n诶嘿嘿……♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:66cc65ab7079ad11eb45123e934dda12d311e74b5234d71dd027a2193f4b1e59",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_5:1_5_032_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:c28edc63e93d9d21210e3815361165c8080a27260c58cdcbaffced5d00661b70",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_2:1_5_033_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "たくさん仕事してすぐにビッグになってやるぜ。\nだからオレから目を離すなよ！",
        "text": "我要接好多好多工作，马上成为大明星！\n所以目光可别从我身上移开哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:adb731ace44d26ae2f699972ae701b0dbe87952fdc181a2002bc75206b780db9",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_2:1_5_033_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_033shr_1_5_033_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:f7acf76e908a4001dc859efaf5aef2aea504853ed7dee911a0ac016236a117c1",
      "title": 308,
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日のお仕事は、子供向けテーマパークの\nアンバサダーとしてイベント出演になります。",
        "text": "今天的工作，是以儿童主题乐园的大使身份\n出席活动。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:72b6cbf104d38586da973cc59e5e0ac0dcc3b493db4a252ddb93887bd1367cd1",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_03:1_5_033_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:a315bb349a2178aec15abb16d33ba5470bd0ae474ceced82a93bc82e514ee052",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_8:1_5_035_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "長丁場の収録だったが、\n体力配分は完璧だったので問題ない。",
        "text": "虽然是一场长时间的持久录制，\n但体力分配得很完美，并无大碍。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:cad03a62153799fe6f1fb1bf71f2b819d2f7ff6e12cff1a13b73eff8ceafc7d5",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_8:1_5_035_00_8:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:a92bf1d29da37b31e5d5ffcdf29d770e162683cb47d12b6baba9b0b979673bf2",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_3:1_5_036_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "Very tightなトレーニングも\nenjoyしたもの勝ちさ♪",
        "text": "哪怕是Very tight的训练，\n只要能enjoy就是赢家哦♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:11df2675776bc61f303f39fb3cf801914cb50a4565b1d43248725fda9a74a128",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_3:1_5_036_00_3:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:a97cefaae1e93a3a0686a736ddb24d0e0cbc1166d9dc1a142e02b7a83e0a22e2",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_4:1_5_037_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "大金が転がり込むような仕事とかない？\n……なんてね、へへ。",
        "text": "有没有那种能大笔捞钱的工作啊？\n……开玩笑的啦，嘿嘿。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:805fd537dbbca4d7413f2ca408a104e3a2f0a2f440bb91cd32a7b6d0d9286739",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_4:1_5_037_00_4:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:2ac4a6c3878af88475e85a452d0150e527b8f4676ece20e5cbb82724a9be6bdc",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_7:1_5_038_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "差し入れ持って来てくれたのか。\n●●●●プロデューサー、ありがとう。",
        "text": "特意给我带慰劳品过来了吗。\n●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bf12ad262c8817fe7c77dc1927eb9c195d4c18054bbcfe2a42f8ccba59cc2535",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_7:1_5_038_00_7:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:6c3349345d5042da6710aac10a5edd686053e8c65160a0e82ae4bf30551bb90d",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_3:1_5_039_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "はは、すごい声援……。\n●●●●●●●●●●師匠、アイドルって最高ッスね！",
        "text": "哈哈，好热烈的欢呼声……\n●●●●●●●●●●师父，当偶像真是太棒了！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8db9bdb0d70ff758d618bc640a2d7d195f03d9388a19ec6b9707bed99e827f92",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_3:1_5_039_00_3:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:ea3ae446724a0d3de1307c2c28711e598fe3395861a3a57f84100890aca2dac3",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_0:1_5_040_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "おい、オマエ！\nオレ様にふさわしい仕事を持ってきたんだろーな？",
        "text": "喂，你！\n肯定给我拿来了配得上本大爷的工作吧？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:eef813e021f340a4b1e8a3b11ea74a1c0e0864f23d5861e2ade88b79dd829be3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_0:1_5_040_00_0:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:59f46ec43c5097a879053750d150e4d81eece9f506a614957689588eb880e333",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_5:1_5_041_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "早起きできたので、少し部屋の掃除をしたんです。\n整理整頓して気持ちのいいスタートを切れました！",
        "text": "今天起得很早，所以稍微打扫了一下房间。\n收拾得整整齐齐，迎来了神清气爽的一天！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b222dd6984a1cc4f5f70cc03c0a08f84accbc7a7b5f77f76adf024365cca65a5",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_5:1_5_041_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:91d3975cad636e17b945498bea1ead5c64d1339e0639a6c499e9bd6556db3d5c",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_1:1_5_043_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "…時間がありそうだ。発声練習をしてくる。\nスタンバイまでには戻ってくるから安心してくれ。",
        "text": "…看来还有些时间。我去练练发声。\n待命前会回来的，请放心。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:91988fd58477e1671c51c37111c070a477a4eb6c0f965d01deb46b1ac6909ed7",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_1:1_5_043_00_1:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:dcc88acfc60508a541832f04530a5ce55da992448e544a3997d14bc2e6f9c6b7",
      "title": 349,
      "opening": {
        "source": "…今日の共演者にキノコの専門家がいるだろう？\n彼の著書が家にあるんだ。",
        "text": "…今天的共演嘉宾里有一位蘑菇专家对吧？\n我家有他的著作。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8a1e84943e7efd8e89e829079c618e1ab588f4053ed0d62b87352382ecd1c567",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:74903468813155f77bf6261b946607c5dfd78f41fab1af5442f25d5e9c5df849",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_8:1_5_044_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "演技レッスンが終わったら、掃除の時間だ。\n一度使った場所は、使う前よりも綺麗にってな。",
        "text": "演技课结束后，就是打扫时间了。\n用过的地方，要弄得比用之前更干净才行。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:87bc0fbaea882112b8328c4b8c43956eb7fe315eb8d62404eaae97fd6d0bd570",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_8:1_5_044_00_8:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_045sor_1_5_045_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:b193acc6a74811c2f5bd86914dd010c871ef61c115c7cf343c70edbcbe725cc8",
      "title": 355,
      "opening": {
        "source": "ランキング形式で、\n新書を紹介させていただきましたー。",
        "text": "我用排行榜的形式，\n为大家介绍了新书哦～",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d2e20f0c53bc1c89780f0394e86433c8bf11e66c9869cff0f47469ef30a1f8c2",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_045sor_1_5_045_02:1_5_045_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:ab9a5b7df47f537d4c578ccbcc50747173f93a6855a21b51ab7c67fe2b27e2bb",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_2:1_5_046_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーさん。\n仕事の確認をしたいのですが、よろしいでしょうか？",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n我想确认一下工作的内容，可以打扰一下吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9bb11d5489a87961df67b50c1cfc89788525286168dcae662afc04d11c79bcb3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_2:1_5_046_00_2:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_046chr_1_5_046_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:3015dff6f29581c623f9cb8e65dee0c6b6dad5f77d440b2951cff74a6eac31c2",
      "title": 360,
      "opening": {
        "source": "（えっと、クリスさんは……いた！　他にも\nモデルさんがたくさんいるのに、目立っているな）",
        "text": "（那个，克里斯先生……找到了！明明还有\n很多其他模特在，但他却格外显眼呢）",
        "source_hash": "sha256:45d9a476a52356baaef1cec18ad27418c379ba496fe17f7a60fd5984d53e7e9c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_03:1_5_046_03:cmd-000013:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:250f5cf967da5ddf1041dca5f4d250b1ebdb06cac9ce3133e3f2159727393dec",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_1:1_5_047_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "観客の声援って、気分が上がるね。\n……あー、凄く楽しかった！",
        "text": "观众的欢呼声，真是让人心情高涨啊。\n……啊——超级开心的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d7b5d62a162f299ff4a101321c02c1f1fa4b4fa77d6eff02e5b8b14c30e3da8e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_1:1_5_047_00_1:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:bf08397fb45cb3b5d00ae3e76bedc8be00ae43bd47e25be8827f4573238c51b2",
      "title": 365,
      "opening": {
        "source": "うわ、まさかの展開？\nこの先、どうなるんだ……。コイツら一体……。",
        "text": "哇，居然是这种展开？\n接下来会变成怎样啊……这家伙到底……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b7c3ed5532eed508aa29231bfd419a14c3f2e98403091938c38166ec5d73e5ed",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000022:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:b151f5f2fcc00634c590a4a8f990830a94d6836a197007a818b433a830d6a10b",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_6:1_5_048_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "わぁ、●●●●●●●●●●ぴぃちゃんから\n差し入れだ♪",
        "text": "哇，是●●●●●●●●●●P酱送来的\n慰劳品♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9e50e3abe7c13cd0b7aeda0ab6fdf324dcb5f6721cae3dab6dc6505c897da900",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_6:1_5_048_00_6:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:51c4fe8bab03a9e026bf68edf205896915fdf5aa3197adef9b55a37e3fc77b5a",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_4:1_5_049_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "差し入れを持って来た。\nお前も遠慮せず食べていい。",
        "text": "我带了慰劳品来。\n你也别客气，吃吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:11f77d68e1b8a08c3842f877aa4cb177cf5efe6b7e4c2e89c781a7670d8ac16c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_4:1_5_049_00_4:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "5_01_006_23_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:a0ac86d9586263182e539b96f22abf7aadd766fbf5349e3a72176ae6d63e2a6e",
      "record": {
        "source": "まさに天にも昇る心地",
        "text": "简直像要飞上天一般",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ed058a79a8c80a8dd68941eca3e341ce9fadc362bbf0ffc4cc3a4515ab77bfc5",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:ed058a79a8c80a8dd68941eca3e341ce9fadc362bbf0ffc4cc3a4515ab77bfc5"
      }
    },
    "5_01_013_22_b": {
      "revision": "sha256:a525fc9bfbd8dcd5985a8bcdd746f885c73567fd76a045f129a9f29a4f7eaaa5",
      "record": {
        "source": "とびっきりのプレゼント",
        "text": "最棒的礼物",
        "source_hash": "sha256:625dcdf90d02b0937915d6d253846393c139379f671319b6f2ba603f7e493cff",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:625dcdf90d02b0937915d6d253846393c139379f671319b6f2ba603f7e493cff"
      }
    },
    "5_01_015_23_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:7948928b383ff7e39326ed5672477f25b7c708b1b42db61634795ef82c961774",
      "record": {
        "source": "幸運のチョコレート",
        "text": "幸运的巧克力",
        "source_hash": "sha256:e3c9669733131cdd757b8c8c7ff870b16d1f814003b0c7587e56577cf87508f8",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:e3c9669733131cdd757b8c8c7ff870b16d1f814003b0c7587e56577cf87508f8"
      }
    },
    "5_01_027_22_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:f205062b89ad3f695d2a8f5cd91f46e3cd34443579f48e2594fa4796f31086d2",
      "record": {
        "source": "気持ちのこもった贈り物",
        "text": "饱含心意的礼物",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4b3c6f4cb133bb1d7b76921dd3cbcfdb1ccc971a38b8b1a6fd751dd9a91263f5",
